# DGGCOOL Environment Variables
#
# Copy this file to .env (local) or set these in Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables
#
# ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ IMPORTANT: The ZAI_API_KEY is REQUIRED for video, voiceover, and    │
# │ LLM features (Enhance, Keywords, Script) to work on Vercel.        │
# │ Without it, only image generation works (via free Pollinations).    │
# └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
#
# HOW TO GET YOUR FREE Z.AI API KEY:
#   1. Go to https://chat.z.ai and sign up (free)
#   2. Click your avatar → Settings → API Keys
#   3. Click "Create Key" → copy the key
#   4. Paste it below (local) or add to Vercel env vars

ZAI_API_KEY=your_zai_api_key_here

# Optional: increase Node.js memory for builds (Vercel handles this automatically)
# NODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size=4096
HF_API_KEY=your_huggingface_token_here
